[{:db/id "q-158032/selection/80238f4bc69d6d28d500041cf122e859f2a017988ed7be0aef8dfbf64315d8f3" :answer/id #uuid "446e9e42-59c3-5c44-8810-9675d88fef87" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{5x+1}{3x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158032/selection/cb5e99ddeae43754c7e6f5a581630ea09d37e83e00db5a5c821bd4c979a612d2" :answer/id #uuid "9369d5ba-993f-530b-bebb-527c9f8a6227" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5x+1}{3x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{y}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158032/selection/a6b771abee41cff15901feaea55d5fd3d77488ce47b63636601fbbf164f99244" :answer/id #uuid "4d35dae1-0dc0-5edb-b6e3-9ebf5c5a173d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3x}{5x+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158032/selection/6e780dec7473dfc262d7815fa515db713de0847d87fb69d07f4ca85424112998" :answer/id #uuid "c5b26c3d-d0c1-5309-8928-045ee49a1bf6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5xy+y}{3x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158032/selection/2a5fc36c7c87a1b890e581bcb0af1aa952607928fefc2d21047d80fa9c6f751a" :answer/id #uuid "5528912c-c515-5e09-b7ef-0ceaed5cad40" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3x}{5x+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158032/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b6fde92c-ad65-57da-bfe3-b36373d0c28f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-158032/selection/2a5fc36c7c87a1b890e581bcb0af1aa952607928fefc2d21047d80fa9c6f751a" :answer-field/choices ["q-158032/selection/80238f4bc69d6d28d500041cf122e859f2a017988ed7be0aef8dfbf64315d8f3" "q-158032/selection/cb5e99ddeae43754c7e6f5a581630ea09d37e83e00db5a5c821bd4c979a612d2" "q-158032/selection/a6b771abee41cff15901feaea55d5fd3d77488ce47b63636601fbbf164f99244" "q-158032/selection/6e780dec7473dfc262d7815fa515db713de0847d87fb69d07f4ca85424112998" "q-158032/selection/2a5fc36c7c87a1b890e581bcb0af1aa952607928fefc2d21047d80fa9c6f751a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-158032" :question/id #uuid "51864f19-79b2-5424-a683-f1c19d820ede" :question/math-academy-id "q-158032" :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3x}{5xy+y}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A differentiable equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differentiable equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{3x}{(5x+1)y} \\\\  & =\\frac{3x}{5x+1}\\cdot \\frac{1}{y}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\ny\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3x}{5x+1}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-158032/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c0d908f1-591e-5cb6-afc5-fa7ec44ec326"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158032"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-158024/selection/b770451beaf6f7b3b4be76bcaf3219f5c98e4090efd637024acc51824b797182" :answer/id #uuid "87d3e9fd-5fdf-5afb-9e2a-6b5a01de7e7b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{3}^{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{-2y}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158024/selection/0a2bc3d203705d322b9f3b3e00de8697e3996415e29244d74de7511a9e9ab90d" :answer/id #uuid "5f76d46b-9f16-54b6-bb30-5d6a44bbe6ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{3}^{2y-x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158024/selection/ec482eec446007a651123bdb798f5e22ea8ed6c9788006aaefde8a19194bce06" :answer/id #uuid "23dfaed0-5117-5fd4-b515-a9bb1cb3da4c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{3}^{2y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158024/selection/94763254a697f29462b7dc10a430b7342ad9a17430b341a4bc5e1b39307f488e" :answer/id #uuid "e233e492-6358-590d-af86-af8e9a192db5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{3}^{-2y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158024/selection/d9d0b95afc95ae929c14eb3c209a363d0cee79399a851e8706f8326e0e58c8a5" :answer/id #uuid "4bb0cd05-3996-5709-bba4-01e35976089d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{3}^{-x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{-2y}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158024/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "265667e0-1e7b-538f-ab08-7d67c89f4053" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-158024/selection/ec482eec446007a651123bdb798f5e22ea8ed6c9788006aaefde8a19194bce06" :answer-field/choices ["q-158024/selection/b770451beaf6f7b3b4be76bcaf3219f5c98e4090efd637024acc51824b797182" "q-158024/selection/0a2bc3d203705d322b9f3b3e00de8697e3996415e29244d74de7511a9e9ab90d" "q-158024/selection/ec482eec446007a651123bdb798f5e22ea8ed6c9788006aaefde8a19194bce06" "q-158024/selection/94763254a697f29462b7dc10a430b7342ad9a17430b341a4bc5e1b39307f488e" "q-158024/selection/d9d0b95afc95ae929c14eb3c209a363d0cee79399a851e8706f8326e0e58c8a5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-158024" :question/id #uuid "8bade680-0dc4-5586-bef6-26a4162ebc7c" :question/math-academy-id "q-158024" :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{x-2y}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A differentiable equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differentiable equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{x}\\cdot {3}^{-2y}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n{3}^{2y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{x}\\,.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-158024/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c0d908f1-591e-5cb6-afc5-fa7ec44ec326"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158024"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-158030/selection/77f5729490c8a2db554254b1edcdb1e616705dbb86826f404acb92e224db513e" :answer/id #uuid "3ba46091-b1ac-5bf0-827c-e656f2f380e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{y}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158030/selection/c51fc005eebe2bf6088332c8d521b8d0af1e83e4217b77ee2a6ae76decc34a3c" :answer/id #uuid "349181be-f51a-5505-ade1-2581caf7b8cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158030/selection/ee8ca5d2d2d3118555c7aac5bed924c159886ef46935a7b0fff1614331388eaf" :answer/id #uuid "f084ee2b-dff0-5318-a6d9-725b4d6520ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{y}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158030/selection/dce818dad76cee787ccf13b62a50fdc69f9ceb47a6225e3dff36e761223ee9d0" :answer/id #uuid "2995811d-888a-510d-b2d2-49a76e9e291a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{y}{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158030/selection/4c7f71bcbf502a77ee4f9bfae9bdb5e579d777f7e1212ebdba345e02bc584030" :answer/id #uuid "d7706aec-b796-5cb0-941f-93108d5a33fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158030/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1686f4e0-81e5-5fcf-b13d-1fb951582ac7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-158030/selection/4c7f71bcbf502a77ee4f9bfae9bdb5e579d777f7e1212ebdba345e02bc584030" :answer-field/choices ["q-158030/selection/77f5729490c8a2db554254b1edcdb1e616705dbb86826f404acb92e224db513e" "q-158030/selection/c51fc005eebe2bf6088332c8d521b8d0af1e83e4217b77ee2a6ae76decc34a3c" "q-158030/selection/ee8ca5d2d2d3118555c7aac5bed924c159886ef46935a7b0fff1614331388eaf" "q-158030/selection/dce818dad76cee787ccf13b62a50fdc69f9ceb47a6225e3dff36e761223ee9d0" "q-158030/selection/4c7f71bcbf502a77ee4f9bfae9bdb5e579d777f7e1212ebdba345e02bc584030"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-158030" :question/id #uuid "b23b9992-f35a-5637-9337-07c3765e33b8" :question/math-academy-id "q-158030" :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{y}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A differentiable equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differentiable equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x\\cdot \\frac{1}{y}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\ny\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-158030/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c0d908f1-591e-5cb6-afc5-fa7ec44ec326"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158030"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-157692"] :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x+y}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A differentiable equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differentiable equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x}\\cdot {e}^{y}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{{e}^{y}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x},\n$$\n\nor, equivalently,\n\n$$\n{e}^{-y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x}.\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-14246/selection/08163f33a91501eeea538f4413e341287b75861ce58fbddf500144af7d5efbc2" :answer/id #uuid "5f52c8c9-d6de-58ee-91ad-bf2e045bc556" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{y}=\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14246/selection/ba7fb13ccf8de8428e84281479e4a2bf2162509c6cd57c68af1db30e3a8fb9b5" :answer/id #uuid "e36f872f-913a-5704-a503-e10668381559" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y|={e}^{x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14246/selection/2fafb94749b17aad9e5fbb92f40aabf531af05a93e010e056da2cbe85a2157c7" :answer/id #uuid "765f9dac-a050-545d-b2f3-748ddfdc0ec2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y|={e}^{\\sqrt{x}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14246/selection/0dc456d4420c4a4e27033c5f1fc2dadb41766d408372d054cc7537ed3b9e1228" :answer/id #uuid "3a0a4e59-6e8c-5a15-92e2-ba0b4bf52e8c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{\\sqrt{x}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14246/selection/750e2717f3c3d3c2d7d0a572f305b713d03403bfc23387328ab5ecaba73c2dee" :answer/id #uuid "2d2a1b6e-0641-5341-a621-62a841c6e50c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-14246/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3b1bce90-263b-5083-b9f4-8c401c598651" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-14246/selection/ba7fb13ccf8de8428e84281479e4a2bf2162509c6cd57c68af1db30e3a8fb9b5" :answer-field/choices ["q-14246/selection/08163f33a91501eeea538f4413e341287b75861ce58fbddf500144af7d5efbc2" "q-14246/selection/ba7fb13ccf8de8428e84281479e4a2bf2162509c6cd57c68af1db30e3a8fb9b5" "q-14246/selection/2fafb94749b17aad9e5fbb92f40aabf531af05a93e010e056da2cbe85a2157c7" "q-14246/selection/0dc456d4420c4a4e27033c5f1fc2dadb41766d408372d054cc7537ed3b9e1228" "q-14246/selection/750e2717f3c3d3c2d7d0a572f305b713d03403bfc23387328ab5ecaba73c2dee"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-14246" :question/id #uuid "84c2841a-a505-5fa1-920b-ad0e7026b757" :question/math-academy-id "q-14246" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=y{e}^{x}$ for $y\\ne 0.$" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =y{e}^{x} \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={e}^{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int {e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int {e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|y| & ={e}^{x}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y|={e}^{x}+C\n$$" :questi